1
00:01:30,520 --> 00:01:34,000
Someone actually tried to steal
the medicinal herbs from you?

2
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:37,400
What's baffling is that
those herbs aren't valuable

3
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:42,400
Why did the bandit take off with
the common herbs instead of my money?

4
00:01:42,600 --> 00:01:46,200
What's more, the imperial dispensary
doesn't stock any of those herbs

5
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:48,800
And we were robbed
whilst on the mountain

6
00:01:48,800 --> 00:01:51,800
How odd. The imperial dispensary is
a treasure trove of medicinal herbs

7
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:54,200
Could the mastermind be
behind the robbery?

8
00:02:04,800 --> 00:02:09,200
-Is His Majesty getting better?
-No. He's still bedridden

9
00:02:10,200 --> 00:02:15,400
Don't worry, Your Highness.
His Majesty leads a blessed life

10
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:19,800
I'm sure Physician Mei has come up
with the prescription

11
00:02:20,200 --> 00:02:23,800
Although I lost the medicinal herbs
meant for His Majesty,

12
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:25,400
I managed to find the replacement

13
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:29,800
I can quite safely say His Majesty
will recover from his illness

14
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:31,400
You've worked hard

15
00:02:34,200 --> 00:02:36,800
Your Highness,
I have a bold request to make

16
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:37,800
Speak

17
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:41,480
Would Your Highness brew the medicine
for His Majesty personally?

18
00:02:41,480 --> 00:02:45,000
-I'll see to it right away
-Thank you, Your Highness

19
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:03,600
Father, you're looking much better

20
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:05,920
Congratulations, Your Majesty

21
00:03:05,920 --> 00:03:09,000
Her Highness' personal supervision of
the brewing has paid off

22
00:03:09,200 --> 00:03:11,200
Time for my medicine

23
00:03:15,200 --> 00:03:17,600
I shan't take the medicine today

24
00:03:17,600 --> 00:03:20,400
Inform the Imperial Kitchen
to prepare my meals

25
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:23,800
That's great news! Congratulations
on Your Majesty's recovery

26
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:26,400
-Be going
-Yes, Your Majesty

27
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:32,400
I want more pork, beef, mutton,
and duck in my meals

28
00:03:35,200 --> 00:03:38,400
The physician you got for me
was Mei...

29
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:41,000
-Mei Shouquan!
-That's right. Mei Shouquan

30
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:45,400
What a queer name. I feel much better
after taking his prescription

31
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:47,800
In fact, he has a friend
called Wu Fuqi

32
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:49,400
Wu Fuqi (no blessing)?

33
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:52,800
-There is also Wei Delu
-Oh, that chap

34
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:55,200
Mei Shouquan (no longevity),

35
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:57,800
Wu Fuqi (no blessing) and
Wei Delu (no rank)...

36
00:03:57,800 --> 00:03:59,800
Such depressing names

37
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:02,200
Put together, their names
mean blessing (fu),

38
00:04:02,200 --> 00:04:04,400
rank (lu) and longevity (shou)!

39
00:04:05,200 --> 00:04:08,200
Blessing, rank and longevity?
That's true

40
00:04:08,200 --> 00:04:10,200
That's auspicious

41
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:11,800
Father

42
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:19,800
Father, I have something important
to tell you

43
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:21,200
What is it?

44
00:04:21,200 --> 00:04:23,800
It's about the essay
by this year's top scholar

45
00:04:24,200 --> 00:04:30,000
I've read it. It touched on
the epidemic in Ping'an Town

46
00:04:30,600 --> 00:04:33,520
Huang Xinxin is a literary talent

47
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:37,400
But I don't think that
he wrote that piece of essay

48
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:38,800
No way

49
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:41,200
Someone cheated in the examination

50
00:04:41,200 --> 00:04:46,000
So who do you think wrote
that piece of essay?

51
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:47,200
Wei Delu

52
00:04:47,400 --> 00:04:49,400
Wei Delu? Have you any proof?

53
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:52,400
Father, you could let
the two men confront each other

54
00:04:53,400 --> 00:04:56,400
If I grant an appeal so readily,

55
00:04:56,400 --> 00:04:58,600
the Imperial Court will be in chaos

56
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:01,400
Father, this matter has
far-reaching consequences

57
00:05:01,400 --> 00:05:05,200
The kingdom is at stake. You must
get to the bottom of things

58
00:05:07,200 --> 00:05:12,000
All right. Summon the two men
to the Palace tomorrow

59
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:14,200
Wise is Father!

60
00:05:31,400 --> 00:05:33,800
Get up.
Sleep no more

61
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:35,400
It's late in the day

62
00:05:37,400 --> 00:05:39,800
Get up!

63
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:47,400
Your breath stinks!
You reek of alcohol

64
00:05:47,400 --> 00:05:50,200
You stink!
When was the last time you bathed?

65
00:05:50,200 --> 00:05:52,400
Why did you become so dispirited?

66
00:05:52,400 --> 00:05:57,200
Stay this way and you'll only
give yourself up to ruin

67
00:05:57,200 --> 00:05:59,400
Even Ma Ruyi has chosen to ignore you

68
00:05:59,520 --> 00:06:03,200
Tell her to leave me alone.
She's such a pain

69
00:06:03,200 --> 00:06:05,200
Spare me from her nagging

70
00:06:05,400 --> 00:06:09,200
I don't deny Ruyi is a pain and a nag

71
00:06:09,200 --> 00:06:11,400
-But of course
-You!

72
00:06:13,200 --> 00:06:15,680
Why is Ruyi such a pain and a nag?

73
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:20,800
Why did she and Princess Ruining
sneak into the academy...

74
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:22,800
to steal the examination essays?

75
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:26,600
Why did she steal the essay and
present it to His Majesty...

76
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:28,800
in a bid to file an appeal for you?

77
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:32,000
Why did she do that?
It doesn't pay to be kind

78
00:06:34,200 --> 00:06:36,400
File an appeal? What appeal?

79
00:06:36,400 --> 00:06:40,400
An appeal to find out why
you weren't even in the top three

80
00:06:40,400 --> 00:06:43,200
His Majesty has summoned you

81
00:06:43,200 --> 00:06:45,800
But are you free to see His Majesty?

82
00:06:46,200 --> 00:06:48,200
-His Majesty wants to see me?
-Yes!

83
00:06:48,200 --> 00:06:49,200
Let's go!

84
00:06:50,800 --> 00:06:55,000
-Tell her I'm sorry when you see her
-You tell her personally

85
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:57,800
An apology made personally
is more sincere

86
00:06:58,000 --> 00:07:02,800
You're my brother. Just a word
from you and she'll forgive me

87
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:03,800
Well?

88
00:07:07,400 --> 00:07:09,800
Let me look at you.
Done!

89
00:07:10,400 --> 00:07:12,400
-What was I saying?
-Miss Ma

90
00:07:13,200 --> 00:07:16,800
Yes, yes. If I talk to her,
she'll certainly give me a hard time

91
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:22,000
That's true. You're not me.
She doesn't dare defy my wishes

92
00:07:22,200 --> 00:07:27,400
Really? I'd say you're the one
who doesn't dare defy her wishes

93
00:07:27,600 --> 00:07:29,920
Oh yeah?
I'm showing her respect

94
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:33,000
Done!

95
00:07:33,200 --> 00:07:36,600
-Why is she so nice to us?
-I'm the reason why!

96
00:07:37,400 --> 00:07:38,800
-Hold it!
-What?

97
00:07:41,400 --> 00:07:44,000
-Look at that
-My view is being blocked

98
00:07:44,400 --> 00:07:46,400
Put my leg down

99
00:07:50,200 --> 00:07:51,800
So cute!

100
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:55,400
Can you not copy what I say?

101
00:07:56,600 --> 00:08:00,800
So cute!
It's smiling at me

102
00:08:03,200 --> 00:08:05,600
It's looking at you and me

103
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:09,800
-His Majesty is expecting us
-Yes, His Majesty is expecting us

104
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:11,400
Goodbye, darling

105
00:08:12,400 --> 00:08:15,800
I have summoned all of you here
only because...

106
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:19,800
it's been reported that someone
cheated in this year's examination

107
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:24,400
Hence I've summoned all of you here
to verify the facts

108
00:08:24,400 --> 00:08:26,400
Wise is Your Majesty

109
00:08:26,400 --> 00:08:28,000
Wise is Your Majesty

110
00:08:28,200 --> 00:08:30,800
Is Huang Xinxin,
the new top scholar, present?

111
00:08:31,200 --> 00:08:34,400
Your Majesty, he had a drop
too much last night

112
00:08:34,400 --> 00:08:36,200
He'll be here shortly

113
00:08:41,400 --> 00:08:43,400
Long live Your Majesty...

114
00:08:45,400 --> 00:08:47,400
Are you Huang Xinxin?

115
00:08:48,800 --> 00:08:49,800
Get up!

116
00:08:51,200 --> 00:08:52,800
Wake up!

117
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:59,400
I want both of you to recite the
essay you wrote at the examination

118
00:09:00,400 --> 00:09:02,200
The essay?

119
00:09:02,400 --> 00:09:06,800
Why do the masses esteem food?
You've come to the right person

120
00:09:06,800 --> 00:09:08,800
I've always loved food

121
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:13,000
I'll eat anything that is edible

122
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:19,200
Delicacies from all corners of
the earth have I tasted

123
00:09:20,400 --> 00:09:21,400
Impressive?

124
00:09:22,400 --> 00:09:25,200
Any more nonsense from you and
your head will roll!

125
00:09:27,200 --> 00:09:29,400
Wei Delu, you go

126
00:09:31,200 --> 00:09:35,200
Your humble subject asks
to have it written down instead

127
00:09:35,400 --> 00:09:38,400
In fact, I shall write it
in reverse order

128
00:09:39,680 --> 00:09:43,920
That is a bold request.
Men, prepare the stationery

129
00:10:09,200 --> 00:10:12,400
Your Majesty, the essay is completed

130
00:10:12,400 --> 00:10:15,400
For Your Majesty's perusal, please

131
00:10:17,200 --> 00:10:20,200
Zha Daoguang, examine the essay

132
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:22,400
Yes, Your Majesty

133
00:10:27,800 --> 00:10:31,400
Your Majesty,
it's the Top Scholar's essay indeed

134
00:10:31,400 --> 00:10:34,400
It's correctly written
even in reverse order

135
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:38,600
Your Majesty, we have a problem here

136
00:10:38,600 --> 00:10:41,400
Here, Your Lordship.
A stroke is missing

137
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:45,800
Your Majesty, the character "huang"
has the top stroke missing,

138
00:10:45,800 --> 00:10:48,200
thus implying that
Your Majesty is headless

139
00:10:48,200 --> 00:10:50,200
That warrants a death penalty

140
00:11:05,800 --> 00:11:07,800
A stroke is missing

141
00:11:08,200 --> 00:11:11,800
Your Majesty, the character "huang"
has the top stroke missing,

142
00:11:11,800 --> 00:11:13,400
thus implying that
Your Majesty is headless

143
00:11:13,400 --> 00:11:15,400
That warrants a death penalty

144
00:11:16,200 --> 00:11:19,800
A stroke is actually missing?
Bring me the essay

145
00:11:19,800 --> 00:11:21,200
Yes, Your Majesty

146
00:11:31,800 --> 00:11:36,200
The characters "bai" and "wang"
combine to form "huang"

147
00:11:36,200 --> 00:11:40,400
Are you suggesting that I'm suffering
from poor eyesight at old age?

148
00:11:40,600 --> 00:11:45,000
Your Majesty, your humble subject
really saw one stroke missing

149
00:11:46,200 --> 00:11:48,200
Look at it yourself!

150
00:11:52,680 --> 00:11:56,200
Your Majesty, there was
one stroke missing just now

151
00:11:56,200 --> 00:11:58,400
-His Lordship saw it too
-Utter nonsense!

152
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:02,480
Lord Zha, besides your eyesight,
are your brains failing too?

153
00:12:05,800 --> 00:12:09,920
Wei Delu, what is your motive?
How could you cheat His Majesty?

154
00:12:18,200 --> 00:12:19,800
It's the ant!

155
00:12:21,800 --> 00:12:23,000
Thank you

156
00:12:27,200 --> 00:12:28,200
Thank you

157
00:12:30,800 --> 00:12:35,920
Wise is Your Majesty. There is
no mistake in the character

158
00:12:36,520 --> 00:12:39,800
Zha Daoguang,
you've been most audacious

159
00:12:39,800 --> 00:12:44,800
On account of your past loyalty,
I gave you a chance

160
00:12:44,800 --> 00:12:49,400
But you remained unrepentant and
tried to frame the honest and upright

161
00:12:49,400 --> 00:12:53,000
I have no use for
a disloyal man like you

162
00:12:53,200 --> 00:12:54,600
-Men!
-Yes, Your Majesty

163
00:12:54,600 --> 00:12:56,800
Have mercy, Your Majesty

164
00:12:57,200 --> 00:13:00,800
Throw Zha Daoguang and
Huang Xinxin into prison

165
00:13:00,800 --> 00:13:02,800
They'll be handed over
to the Board of Punishments

166
00:13:02,800 --> 00:13:06,000
Your humble subject realizes
his folly. Have mercy, Your Majesty

167
00:13:06,200 --> 00:13:09,920
-I'm innocent, Your Majesty!
-Have mercy, Your Majesty...

168
00:13:12,800 --> 00:13:17,400
There was cheating
in the Imperial Examination

169
00:13:17,400 --> 00:13:21,800
The chief examiner, Zha Daoguang,
has been found guilty

170
00:13:21,800 --> 00:13:26,400
I hereby pronounce Wei Delu
as this year's Top Scholar

171
00:13:26,600 --> 00:13:29,400
Wise is Your Majesty

172
00:13:30,200 --> 00:13:31,800
Thank His Majesty

173
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:35,800
Thank you, Your Majesty

174
00:13:36,200 --> 00:13:38,800
Your humble subject
thanks Your Majesty

175
00:13:38,800 --> 00:13:42,400
You've suffered much injustice.
You may rise

176
00:13:43,200 --> 00:13:45,200
Thank you, Your Majesty

177
00:13:47,200 --> 00:13:51,200
Wei Delu, you're a man of fine looks

178
00:13:51,400 --> 00:13:55,400
If you could kick the bad habit of
uttering nonsense,

179
00:13:55,400 --> 00:13:57,600
you'd make a promising talent

180
00:13:58,000 --> 00:14:00,680
Your humble subject
will bear that in mind

181
00:14:01,200 --> 00:14:04,200
There is another person
I'd like to commend

182
00:14:04,200 --> 00:14:08,200
That I've recovered fully
should be credited to...

183
00:14:08,200 --> 00:14:11,200
Physician Mei Shouquan's
dedicated care

184
00:14:11,520 --> 00:14:13,600
Mei Shouquan, receive the edict

185
00:14:16,600 --> 00:14:19,400
Yes, Your Majesty

186
00:14:19,600 --> 00:14:23,520
-You may rise
-Thank you, Your Majesty

187
00:14:25,200 --> 00:14:29,200
Mei Shouquan, you shall be
the chief physician...

188
00:14:29,200 --> 00:14:31,800
overseeing the
Imperial Medical Academy

189
00:14:31,800 --> 00:14:35,200
You shall be my personal physician

190
00:14:39,200 --> 00:14:41,200
Thank you, Your Majesty

191
00:14:41,200 --> 00:14:45,400
But I am only a lowly commoner,
Your Majesty

192
00:14:45,400 --> 00:14:47,400
I dare not take up
such a responsibility

193
00:14:47,680 --> 00:14:51,200
Besides, I am used to
a life of freedom

194
00:14:51,200 --> 00:14:53,800
I may not be able to adapt to life
in the Palace

195
00:14:53,800 --> 00:14:56,200
Please appoint another capable man,
Your Majesty

196
00:14:56,400 --> 00:14:59,800
Should I feel unwell in future...

197
00:15:00,200 --> 00:15:04,800
Should Your Majesty feel unwell
in future,

198
00:15:05,200 --> 00:15:09,200
I promise I'll come to the Palace
to treat Your Majesty without delay

199
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:11,400
Please grant this wish of mine

200
00:15:12,400 --> 00:15:16,000
All right. I shan't force you

201
00:15:17,400 --> 00:15:21,800
You shall be conferred
the title of Divine Physician

202
00:15:22,200 --> 00:15:24,600
You shall return to
your hometown in glory

203
00:15:25,400 --> 00:15:27,600
Thank you, Your Majesty

204
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:34,400
Thank you so much, Your Highness

205
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:39,400
You're a wonderful man
but for your wild talk

206
00:15:39,400 --> 00:15:43,000
Do watch your behaviour from now on.
Don't be so arrogant

207
00:15:43,200 --> 00:15:46,200
Be a good official
who cares for the people

208
00:15:49,200 --> 00:15:53,400
I'm worried that I may not be able
to do it, much as I want to do so

209
00:15:54,200 --> 00:15:56,200
Why did you say that?

210
00:15:56,400 --> 00:16:00,800
From Shi Yaoqian to Chen Daqi
to the scholars around me,

211
00:16:00,800 --> 00:16:04,000
they all see the office
as a place to build their wealth

212
00:16:04,200 --> 00:16:06,200
Once you're named the Top Scholar,

213
00:16:06,200 --> 00:16:10,000
you'll be surrounded by
apple-polishers who...

214
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:13,800
will teach you how to get rich
using your official status

215
00:16:13,800 --> 00:16:16,600
Don't worry on that count.
I'm behind you

216
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:19,200
I'll feedback to Father
on any misdemeanour

217
00:16:19,400 --> 00:16:22,200
Just do what you have to do
without reservation

218
00:16:22,200 --> 00:16:27,400
Thank you, Your Highness.
I will not let you down

219
00:16:28,200 --> 00:16:33,400
Your Highness, there is something
I'd like to highlight to you

220
00:16:34,400 --> 00:16:38,600
Beware of Ouyang Xiaotian

221
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:43,200
What has he done? I sense
some misunderstanding between you

222
00:16:43,400 --> 00:16:46,400
Just be careful of him

223
00:16:46,400 --> 00:16:51,400
Ouyang Xiaotian is not
as simple as he seems

224
00:16:58,200 --> 00:17:00,000
I take my leave

225
00:17:01,400 --> 00:17:02,800
Take care

226
00:17:04,200 --> 00:17:07,800
Take care, Your Highness

227
00:17:21,680 --> 00:17:24,400
Congratulations!
Congratulations to both families

228
00:17:24,400 --> 00:17:29,800
All these years of efforts
have finally paid off

229
00:17:29,800 --> 00:17:34,400
Despite all the hardships,
Shou and Lu never gave up

230
00:17:34,400 --> 00:17:38,200
They only get to where they are today
because of their upright character

231
00:17:38,200 --> 00:17:40,200
You're finally stating facts

232
00:17:40,200 --> 00:17:44,200
But my Fu is still a fugitive

233
00:17:45,200 --> 00:17:49,200
Come on, he's only a physician

234
00:17:49,200 --> 00:17:51,800
He can't hold a candle
to the Top Scholar

235
00:17:51,800 --> 00:17:55,800
The Top Scholar is a talent
who runs the country

236
00:17:55,800 --> 00:17:57,600
The country depends on him

237
00:17:57,800 --> 00:18:01,000
My family will be
counting on your family then

238
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:02,400
No problem!

239
00:18:02,600 --> 00:18:06,800
Will Shou be riding on horseback or
travelling in a sedan?

240
00:18:06,800 --> 00:18:10,000
On horseback, of course!
That will be so imposing

241
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:12,400
No one can see who's inside the sedan

242
00:18:12,400 --> 00:18:15,600
Exactly! But the one on the horseback
is visible to all!

243
00:18:15,800 --> 00:18:20,600
Delu has done the family proud

244
00:18:20,800 --> 00:18:26,800
It's probably thanks to
the good deeds the family has done

245
00:18:26,800 --> 00:18:29,800
How many top scholars
are there each time?

246
00:18:29,800 --> 00:18:33,600
It's also the first time Ping'an Town
produces a top scholar

247
00:18:34,400 --> 00:18:38,200
Are you having me on?
Is my Shou really that capable?

248
00:18:38,400 --> 00:18:40,200
Princess Ruining invited him...

249
00:18:40,200 --> 00:18:43,200
to treat His Majesty
at the Hall of Golden Chimes

250
00:18:43,400 --> 00:18:46,200
He's done a deed of great merit

251
00:18:46,200 --> 00:18:48,200
Mother, there is more

252
00:18:48,200 --> 00:18:53,400
The Emperor has even presented
my brother with a...

253
00:18:53,400 --> 00:18:54,400
A tablet?

254
00:18:55,200 --> 00:18:57,200
Do you want your head to roll?

255
00:18:57,400 --> 00:19:00,200
It's the imperial title of
Divine Physician!

256
00:19:00,200 --> 00:19:02,200
Do you get it?

257
00:19:02,200 --> 00:19:08,400
I bet no one will dare
tell Shou off for putting on airs now

258
00:19:08,600 --> 00:19:09,600
Exactly!

259
00:19:11,200 --> 00:19:14,800
This unruly family certainly
engages in wild talk!

260
00:19:15,200 --> 00:19:19,000
You called us unruly?
Do you see yourself so high up?

261
00:19:19,000 --> 00:19:20,200
Of course!

262
00:19:20,200 --> 00:19:22,800
Don't you be so arrogant

263
00:19:22,800 --> 00:19:26,400
You'll have to come
to my son when you fall sick

264
00:19:26,400 --> 00:19:29,800
-You'll come a-begging!
-I dare say you'll come to us too

265
00:19:29,800 --> 00:19:32,400
I'm sure you'll have lawsuits
in time to come!

266
00:19:33,600 --> 00:19:37,800
Break it up!
Your sons have done you proud

267
00:19:37,800 --> 00:19:40,400
But my Fu is...

268
00:19:40,600 --> 00:19:45,600
-There she goes again
-Please stop making a scene

269
00:19:46,200 --> 00:19:50,200
Just what is that all about?
Now, why isn't Shou here yet?

270
00:19:50,800 --> 00:19:54,400
The hour has passed.
Did they run into some trouble?

271
00:19:54,400 --> 00:19:57,400
I know!
They must have run into bandits

272
00:19:58,400 --> 00:20:00,200
You and your foul mouth!

273
00:20:10,400 --> 00:20:12,200
Here

274
00:20:17,200 --> 00:20:19,800
Smells good.
Let me have some first

275
00:20:19,800 --> 00:20:23,800
No! Today is the day
the three of us turn 29

276
00:20:23,800 --> 00:20:27,000
Fu is on his way here.
Let's wait for him

277
00:20:27,200 --> 00:20:31,200
I'll wait. I waited years to be
the Top Scholar before I became one

278
00:20:32,400 --> 00:20:37,200
Don't talk about what happened
in the Capital when Fu is here

279
00:20:37,200 --> 00:20:41,200
You're now the Top Scholar and I,
a famed physician

280
00:20:41,200 --> 00:20:45,400
He'll feel lousy
if he knows he can't match up to us

281
00:20:45,400 --> 00:20:48,800
-That won't be nice
-You worry too much

282
00:20:48,800 --> 00:20:53,800
Fu isn't as petty as you. He'll be
happy over our achievements

283
00:20:53,800 --> 00:20:57,200
The successful don't talk about
past failures

284
00:20:57,200 --> 00:21:00,800
I'm not calling Fu petty.
I just don't wish to upset him

285
00:21:00,800 --> 00:21:03,400
But we can't keep what happened
from him, can we?

286
00:21:04,200 --> 00:21:08,600
Fine! Then we shall also tell him
about how you tried to hang yourself

287
00:21:08,600 --> 00:21:10,000
Shall we?

288
00:21:11,400 --> 00:21:14,800
We should be tactful
in deed and speech

289
00:21:14,800 --> 00:21:17,800
Let's not talk about the Capital
lest he gets upset

290
00:21:17,800 --> 00:21:19,200
I'm glad you realize that

291
00:21:20,200 --> 00:21:22,200
Brothers, I'm back!

292
00:21:22,800 --> 00:21:24,200
Fu!

293
00:21:27,200 --> 00:21:29,400
Happy Birthday!

294
00:21:29,800 --> 00:21:34,000
I knew you'd turn up. You never
failed to show up on our birthday

295
00:21:34,000 --> 00:21:37,800
Of course!
Are we just having the chicken?

296
00:21:37,800 --> 00:21:41,800
As if we'd be so stingy on ourselves.
Ruyi has gone to buy some food

297
00:21:41,800 --> 00:21:45,200
-I'll go and help Ma-jiejie
-Do you know where she is?

298
00:21:45,200 --> 00:21:47,800
-Yes
-What a sensible girl

299
00:21:50,600 --> 00:21:54,800
You have Miss Ma and
you have Shuangxi

300
00:21:54,800 --> 00:21:58,800
While both of you have
a lady by your side, I am...

301
00:22:01,000 --> 00:22:05,000
Don't be discouraged. You're the most
articulate among the three of us

302
00:22:05,000 --> 00:22:07,800
You've always been the patient sort

303
00:22:07,800 --> 00:22:12,800
For all we know, Her Highness may
have a change of heart down the road

304
00:22:12,800 --> 00:22:14,800
She'll come back to you

305
00:22:16,200 --> 00:22:21,200
Lu, you're an official now.
You'll have no lack of women

306
00:22:23,400 --> 00:22:27,000
How did you find out
I'd been made an official?

307
00:22:27,200 --> 00:22:30,200
Of course! When I arrived in
the city,

308
00:22:30,200 --> 00:22:32,600
I heard about how the people
welcomed home two persons

309
00:22:32,600 --> 00:22:36,400
While one is the Top Scholar,
the other is the Divine Physician

310
00:22:38,200 --> 00:22:41,400
But why are you holing up in here?
You should be celebrating out there

311
00:22:41,600 --> 00:22:45,400
The three of us are brothers.
We are one

312
00:22:45,400 --> 00:22:48,400
We'll only go out there
with you around

313
00:22:48,600 --> 00:22:52,400
We'll drink together and
enjoy ourselves

314
00:22:52,400 --> 00:22:54,400
-That's what I call happiness
-Well said!

315
00:22:55,400 --> 00:22:59,000
Do you still remember what we said
when we became sworn brothers?

316
00:22:59,000 --> 00:23:00,000
You bet!

317
00:23:01,000 --> 00:23:03,800
In the presence of The Trio,
I, Wei Delu...

318
00:23:03,800 --> 00:23:06,800
-I, Mei Shouquan...
-I, Wu Fuqi...

319
00:23:06,800 --> 00:23:09,400
Shall become sworn brothers
from now on

320
00:23:09,400 --> 00:23:12,400
-We'll fight together
-Share our food

321
00:23:12,400 --> 00:23:15,200
We'll play together

322
00:23:15,200 --> 00:23:20,800
We will share weal and woe
from now on!

323
00:23:21,200 --> 00:23:24,200
-The three of us are...
-Good brothers!

324
00:23:25,200 --> 00:23:27,800
-What happened?
-Let's try again

325
00:23:27,800 --> 00:23:30,600
-The three of us are...
-Good...

326
00:23:30,600 --> 00:23:31,800
Brothers...

327
00:23:33,400 --> 00:23:35,200
It's all right now

328
00:23:53,000 --> 00:23:57,800
While one of you is the Top Scholar,
the other is the Divine Physician

329
00:23:57,800 --> 00:24:00,400
I'm very happy for both of you

330
00:24:00,600 --> 00:24:03,200
Thank you.
Come, bottoms up

331
00:24:10,200 --> 00:24:13,800
Fu, your talent
will be recognized one day

332
00:24:13,800 --> 00:24:17,680
Don't be upset.
Your break will come

333
00:24:17,680 --> 00:24:19,800
I'm not upset

334
00:24:19,800 --> 00:24:24,800
Fu, great success doesn't come soon.
What matters is it will come

335
00:24:24,800 --> 00:24:29,000
We just have to work hard
and success will be ours

336
00:24:29,200 --> 00:24:33,000
-Don't despair
-Why should I despair?

337
00:24:33,000 --> 00:24:34,200
I'm not in despair

338
00:24:34,200 --> 00:24:38,000
If you feel like crying,
you may do so in my arms

339
00:24:38,200 --> 00:24:41,200
Do I look like I want to cry?

340
00:24:41,400 --> 00:24:45,200
Fu, we're brothers.
We know how you feel

341
00:24:45,200 --> 00:24:49,600
You're the strongest among us
but you also shed tears easily

342
00:24:49,800 --> 00:24:54,200
If you feel like crying, go ahead.
I'll lend you my shoulders

343
00:24:54,200 --> 00:24:56,200
My shoulders are more comfortable
than his arms

344
00:24:56,400 --> 00:24:58,000
You're crazy

345
00:24:58,200 --> 00:25:05,200
You think I'll feel inferior and sad
now that you've found success

346
00:25:05,200 --> 00:25:07,800
I really feel none of that

347
00:25:07,800 --> 00:25:12,800
I'll have you know that
I've found my goal in life

348
00:25:13,800 --> 00:25:16,800
You have?
Tell us about it

349
00:25:17,200 --> 00:25:19,200
Tree-planting!

350
00:25:19,800 --> 00:25:21,800
Tree-planting?

351
00:25:22,600 --> 00:25:28,800
That's right. You'll find it hard
to believe when I tell you the story

352
00:25:29,800 --> 00:25:33,200
I had a strange encounter
on the day I left Ping'an Town

353
00:25:33,400 --> 00:25:38,000
I ran into a mountain deity
who gave me a powerful right arm

354
00:25:38,200 --> 00:25:42,800
I can easily form a hole
in the ground with just one punch

355
00:25:42,800 --> 00:25:44,400
-Then I plant the tree
-Really?

356
00:25:44,400 --> 00:25:46,600
You don't believe me?

357
00:25:48,200 --> 00:25:50,200
Let me show you

358
00:26:02,200 --> 00:26:03,800
That was impressive!

359
00:26:04,400 --> 00:26:06,400
Now you believe me, huh?

360
00:26:15,600 --> 00:26:19,800
Can you feel my surging blood?

361
00:26:20,800 --> 00:26:25,000
I'm checking your pulse to see
if you've suffered any brain damage

362
00:26:26,200 --> 00:26:30,000
Fu, don't play the prank on me

363
00:26:30,000 --> 00:26:32,800
Did you trick us earlier?

364
00:26:33,800 --> 00:26:38,400
Lu, his pulse is normal. Looks like
he wasn't exaggerating things

365
00:26:40,400 --> 00:26:46,400
Believe me. Planting trees is good.
It's a noble act

366
00:26:46,400 --> 00:26:50,000
Generations after me will enjoy
the shade from the trees I plant

367
00:26:51,000 --> 00:26:53,800
It takes 10 years to grow a tree and
100 years to cultivate a man

368
00:26:54,200 --> 00:26:57,800
Though what I do now
may not reap immediate results,

369
00:26:57,800 --> 00:27:02,400
it will greatly benefit
the many generations to come

370
00:27:04,400 --> 00:27:06,200
You do have a point there

371
00:27:07,000 --> 00:27:10,600
Every vocation has its success story

372
00:27:11,800 --> 00:27:14,800
Since you have a heart
in planting trees,

373
00:27:15,000 --> 00:27:21,400
you may just become
a great gardener one day

374
00:27:23,200 --> 00:27:26,400
That's right!
A great gardener

375
00:27:30,400 --> 00:27:34,200
No one job is above or
beneath another

376
00:27:34,200 --> 00:27:41,600
Be one a top scholar,
a divine physician or a gardener,

377
00:27:41,600 --> 00:27:44,800
success will still come to one

378
00:27:47,200 --> 00:27:52,000
The three of us will see
good days ahead of us

379
00:27:53,200 --> 00:27:57,600
Look. Gone is the dark cloud
above your head

380
00:27:59,800 --> 00:28:01,200
It's gone

381
00:28:01,800 --> 00:28:06,200
Fu, given your special ability now,

382
00:28:06,200 --> 00:28:10,000
no one will dare tick you off
for being arrogant

383
00:28:11,200 --> 00:28:15,800
If the dark cloud comes back,
we will blow it away for you

384
00:28:19,200 --> 00:28:22,400
Your Lordship, before Mei Shouquan
left the Palace,

385
00:28:22,400 --> 00:28:27,800
he told His Majesty the illness
had been brought about by poison

386
00:28:27,800 --> 00:28:33,800
Enraged, His Majesty has ordered
to seek out the mastermind

387
00:28:34,800 --> 00:28:38,800
Then why did you come to me?
Let them investigate the matter

388
00:28:39,200 --> 00:28:43,200
It's a grave matter, Your Lordship

389
00:28:43,200 --> 00:28:47,800
The investigation will trace it to
the snow lotus from Your Lordship

390
00:28:48,200 --> 00:28:50,400
Don't you utter nonsense

391
00:28:50,400 --> 00:28:55,600
The snow lotus was recommended
as part of the treatment

392
00:28:55,600 --> 00:29:01,200
But we merely acted on
the order of Your Lordship

393
00:29:01,400 --> 00:29:10,000
Would His Majesty believe a loyal
marquis betrothed to his daughter...

394
00:29:10,200 --> 00:29:15,000
or a mediocre imperial physician
like you?

395
00:29:15,200 --> 00:29:18,400
Lord Yonghuan, aren't you vicious!

396
00:29:18,600 --> 00:29:21,800
Very well!
Just you wait and see!

397
00:29:27,400 --> 00:29:31,400
What do you want?

398
00:29:33,200 --> 00:29:37,000
Physician Luo, you know
how much you've gained from me

399
00:29:37,000 --> 00:29:39,800
You can't absolve yourself of blame
in this matter

400
00:29:40,200 --> 00:29:42,200
You have two options now

401
00:29:42,200 --> 00:29:46,400
Didn't you say you'd do your utmost
and lay down your life?

402
00:29:50,200 --> 00:29:55,400
If you die now, I promise your family
will be well taken care of

403
00:29:56,200 --> 00:30:01,800
Alternatively, your family
shall meet King of Hades

404
00:30:06,000 --> 00:30:12,200
Ouyang Xiaotian, I hope
you'll keep your promise and...

405
00:30:13,200 --> 00:30:15,400
take good care of my family

406
00:30:16,000 --> 00:30:23,200
Or I'll turn into a vicious ghost
and return to haunt you

407
00:30:39,800 --> 00:30:45,200
Your Majesty, your humble subject
regrets his actions

408
00:30:45,200 --> 00:30:48,400
Your humble subject deserves to die

409
00:31:00,600 --> 00:31:03,800
Physician Luo, you won't be lonely

410
00:31:03,800 --> 00:31:08,400
Physician Zhang and Physician Huang
will join you shortly

411
00:31:11,200 --> 00:31:15,400
Good fortune shall follow us
from now on! Cheers!

412
00:31:18,800 --> 00:31:20,800
How could you get yourselves
so drunk!

413
00:31:21,400 --> 00:31:25,200
Ruyi, why did you smash
our wine bottles?

414
00:31:26,600 --> 00:31:30,800
-Why were you so careless?
-Rather, I am worried!

415
00:31:30,800 --> 00:31:36,400
Worried? We are doing so well now.
You needn't worry about us

416
00:31:37,200 --> 00:31:39,800
Just look at the three of you!

417
00:31:39,800 --> 00:31:42,800
Ruyi, we've done nothing
to upset you

418
00:31:43,200 --> 00:31:47,400
Do you think you can make merry
now that your future looks rosy?

419
00:31:48,000 --> 00:31:51,400
It's true that
things are looking up for us

420
00:31:51,600 --> 00:31:54,800
I am the Top Scholar

421
00:31:55,200 --> 00:32:00,000
Shou has been given
the title of Divine Physician

422
00:32:01,000 --> 00:32:07,000
Fu is a very famous gardener

423
00:32:07,600 --> 00:32:11,400
A shame the titles are
too big for your heads!

424
00:32:14,800 --> 00:32:20,600
Spicy Woman, will you just
cut us some slack?

425
00:32:22,600 --> 00:32:25,800
My words may be jarring on your ears,
but I'll still say them

426
00:32:25,800 --> 00:32:28,800
Trials and tribulations
are lying in wait for you

427
00:32:29,200 --> 00:32:33,600
If you take my warning lightly,
disasters will befall you

428
00:32:38,200 --> 00:32:42,200
You're a hopeless bunch!
Shou, you're no different from them

429
00:32:42,200 --> 00:32:45,200
-You're an utter disappointment!
-Hear me out, Ruyi

430
00:32:45,200 --> 00:32:49,200
The two of them forced me
to drink with them

431
00:32:49,200 --> 00:32:51,200
I have nothing to do with it

432
00:32:55,200 --> 00:33:00,000
Miss Ma, how you love to scare us
with alarming talk

433
00:33:00,000 --> 00:33:03,400
What's wrong with the three of us
enjoying some wine together?

434
00:33:03,400 --> 00:33:05,200
I have your welfare at heart

435
00:33:10,200 --> 00:33:12,200
Ma Ruyi, you are a pain

436
00:33:12,200 --> 00:33:18,200
We're catching up on old times
but you've come to spoil the party

437
00:33:21,400 --> 00:33:23,800
Brother Fuqi,
Miss Ma has a point there

438
00:33:23,800 --> 00:33:26,800
Her words make sense

439
00:33:26,800 --> 00:33:28,400
What sense?

440
00:33:29,000 --> 00:33:33,000
It's unreasonable of you
to upset the three of us

441
00:33:33,400 --> 00:33:36,000
Ma Ruyi, leave!

442
00:33:38,400 --> 00:33:40,400
Ruyi! Ruyi, don't go

443
00:33:42,200 --> 00:33:45,800
-What has become of her?
-She... she...

444
00:33:45,800 --> 00:33:48,200
-Brother Fuqi!
-Ma Ruyi, come here!

445
00:33:50,600 --> 00:33:52,600
Stop teasing Ruyi

446
00:33:54,600 --> 00:33:57,600
I get it...
Ma Ruyi!

447
00:33:59,200 --> 00:34:00,880
Shuangxi, let's go!

448
00:34:04,520 --> 00:34:06,800
Stay here. I'll be going

449
00:34:07,200 --> 00:34:11,400
-What do you want?
-What is going on?

450
00:34:11,400 --> 00:34:16,400
Your fault! You got me so drunk.
I'll get a beating from Ruyi

451
00:34:34,480 --> 00:34:36,200
Zhang Guolao!

452
00:34:38,200 --> 00:34:39,800
Zhang Guolao!

453
00:34:40,200 --> 00:34:41,200
Quiet!

454
00:34:44,200 --> 00:34:45,400
Zhang Guolao!

455
00:34:47,200 --> 00:34:53,600
-What are you doing?
-What's wrong? You look mad

456
00:34:54,600 --> 00:34:59,400
You must help me be rid of
the Obedience Spell

457
00:34:59,400 --> 00:35:02,800
I'm in utter misery now

458
00:35:03,600 --> 00:35:08,800
The Obedience Spell has its pros too.
You learn what makes a virtuous woman

459
00:35:10,200 --> 00:35:14,200
You're responsible for the state
I'm in. Don't be so mean

460
00:35:15,400 --> 00:35:19,200
You can't blame me.
In a bid to save Mei Shouquan,

461
00:35:19,200 --> 00:35:23,800
you allowed Deity of Medicine
to put the curse on you

462
00:35:23,800 --> 00:35:28,200
I did warn you against falling in
love but you ignored my advice

463
00:35:28,400 --> 00:35:30,400
I didn't fall in love

464
00:35:30,400 --> 00:35:34,400
How can Mei Shouquan return to
Celestial Court with a monkey's body?

465
00:35:34,600 --> 00:35:36,800
I had the big picture in mind

466
00:35:36,800 --> 00:35:42,400
In that case, bear with it for now.
Ma-gu, go back!

467
00:35:42,400 --> 00:35:45,400
-I'm staying put
-Lord Erlang, you're here

468
00:35:45,600 --> 00:35:47,800
Go back, Ma-gu!

469
00:35:50,200 --> 00:35:53,200
The spell works all the time.
It's fun!

470
00:35:53,400 --> 00:35:55,800
Ma-gu, come back!

471
00:35:58,400 --> 00:36:00,200
Ma-gu, go back!

472
00:36:03,600 --> 00:36:07,800
Ma-gu... Forget it.
Let's just concentrate on my fishing

473
00:36:14,800 --> 00:36:18,800
A big fish!
Ma-gu, come back...

474
00:36:19,400 --> 00:36:22,200
I'm sorry, Ma-gu

475
00:36:28,400 --> 00:36:30,800
The three of them killed themselves?

476
00:36:31,200 --> 00:36:34,200
They'd plotted against His Majesty

477
00:36:34,600 --> 00:36:39,800
After they were exposed,
they killed themselves out of guilt

478
00:36:40,200 --> 00:36:43,000
Don't take it to heart, Your Highness

479
00:36:43,400 --> 00:36:45,400
Though they're dead,

480
00:36:45,400 --> 00:36:49,400
I don't understand why
they wanted to harm Father

481
00:36:49,400 --> 00:36:51,800
I believe there was a mastermind

482
00:36:52,800 --> 00:36:57,800
Indeed. In fact, I can't tear myself
away from this incident either

483
00:36:58,400 --> 00:36:59,400
You?

484
00:37:00,000 --> 00:37:04,600
Do you recall how the three
physicians argued over the diagnosis?

485
00:37:04,600 --> 00:37:08,800
Yes. In the end, they agreed on
using snow lotus to treat Father

486
00:37:10,000 --> 00:37:16,000
It was a conspiracy with
the envoy from Qie'erqi

487
00:37:16,000 --> 00:37:19,400
The envoy had presented me
with the snow lotus

488
00:37:19,400 --> 00:37:23,000
Then they suggested snow lotus
to treat His Majesty

489
00:37:23,000 --> 00:37:26,400
They wanted to kill His Majesty
through my hands

490
00:37:26,400 --> 00:37:33,000
Should the truth be found out,
I'll be deemed the guilty party

491
00:37:35,200 --> 00:37:37,800
But why did they do that?

492
00:37:38,200 --> 00:37:43,600
Qie'erqi has been eyeing our country,
hence the plot to harm His Majesty

493
00:37:44,200 --> 00:37:47,200
The three physicians
had served Father for years

494
00:37:47,200 --> 00:37:49,800
To think they committed treason
with another state

495
00:37:50,200 --> 00:37:52,200
A fair face hides a foul heart

496
00:37:52,200 --> 00:37:55,800
But the incident has finally
come to a close, Your Highness

497
00:37:55,800 --> 00:37:59,400
His Majesty has decided to sever
diplomatic ties with Qie'erqi

498
00:37:59,400 --> 00:38:01,600
Stop fretting over it, Your Highness

499
00:38:01,800 --> 00:38:07,400
I'll be making a trip to Ping'an.
Your Highness may want to join me

500
00:38:07,400 --> 00:38:09,200
You may take a holiday there

501
00:38:09,200 --> 00:38:12,200
All right, but on one condition

502
00:38:12,200 --> 00:38:13,200
Yes?

503
00:38:13,200 --> 00:38:16,400
Keep me company.
Don't leave me alone

504
00:38:16,400 --> 00:38:19,800
Spend every day with me and
don't argue with me

505
00:38:24,400 --> 00:38:27,200
Yes, Your Highness

506
00:38:31,680 --> 00:38:33,800
Your Excellency, someone is here
to lodge a complaint

507
00:38:34,200 --> 00:38:36,400
-Who?
-Wei Delu

508
00:38:36,600 --> 00:38:38,200
Magistrate Shi

509
00:38:39,600 --> 00:38:40,800
Magistrate Shi

510
00:38:44,400 --> 00:38:48,200
What may I do for you, Lord Wei?
Pardon my tardiness in receiving you

511
00:38:48,200 --> 00:38:55,800
Magistrate Shi, I'm sorry. They have
come to file a case against you

512
00:38:56,200 --> 00:39:00,600
Do you know what offences
you've committed?

513
00:39:01,200 --> 00:39:04,800
Utter nonsense!
What crimes have I committed?

514
00:39:05,200 --> 00:39:08,800
The cheek of you to accuse us
of uttering nonsense!

515
00:39:08,800 --> 00:39:14,200
You stole the cauldron and conspired
with Chen Daqi to sell fake drugs...

516
00:39:14,200 --> 00:39:16,800
to make money

517
00:39:17,200 --> 00:39:19,200
-You... you!
-What?

518
00:39:19,200 --> 00:39:23,400
You framed the innocent, abducted
a girl and tried to molest Ma Ruyi

519
00:39:23,400 --> 00:39:25,800
-Your crimes are unpardonable!
-I...

520
00:39:25,800 --> 00:39:30,800
What! You forced me to marry you.
That's another crime!

521
00:39:32,200 --> 00:39:35,800
You're an official and yet
you broke the law

522
00:39:35,800 --> 00:39:38,000
How shall you answer to everyone?

523
00:39:38,400 --> 00:39:41,800
-How shall you answer to us?
-Utter nonsense!

524
00:39:41,800 --> 00:39:43,800
You're setting me up!

525
00:39:43,800 --> 00:39:46,400
Everyone has got a case against you

526
00:39:46,600 --> 00:39:49,200
Ever since you became
the magistrate here,

527
00:39:49,200 --> 00:39:52,800
you've done nothing but bully the
people and make ill-gotten gains

528
00:39:53,000 --> 00:39:57,800
Just because you're the magistrate
doesn't make you above the law!

529
00:39:57,800 --> 00:40:03,000
You even sent guards after me
when I refused to marry you

530
00:40:03,000 --> 00:40:06,400
You even injured Brother Fuqi.
You're worse than a robber!

531
00:40:07,200 --> 00:40:10,600
You abused your authority.
That is a serious offence

532
00:40:10,600 --> 00:40:13,200
What will you do
if I hand this to His Majesty?

533
00:40:13,200 --> 00:40:16,200
-You're dead meat!
-Who is dead meat?

534
00:40:16,200 --> 00:40:18,600
-Him!
-Who is dead meat?

535
00:40:20,200 --> 00:40:22,200
We have a crowd here

536
00:40:22,400 --> 00:40:25,600
Save me, Your Lordship.
They want me dead

537
00:40:25,800 --> 00:40:30,800
I see. Lord Wei is newly-appointed.
A new broom sweeps clean

538
00:40:31,200 --> 00:40:36,000
Lord Wei, what has Magistrate Shi
done to warrant a death penalty?

539
00:40:36,200 --> 00:40:41,200
Your Lordship, his crimes are
all listed in this petition

540
00:40:41,400 --> 00:40:43,200
For your perusal, please

541
00:40:47,200 --> 00:40:49,800
That's a long list

542
00:40:50,200 --> 00:40:54,400
Magistrate Shi,
explain yourself to everyone

543
00:40:54,600 --> 00:40:57,200
Your Lordship, it's a setup

544
00:40:57,400 --> 00:41:00,200
Mei Shouquan, you found
the cauldron in Eastern Sea

545
00:41:00,200 --> 00:41:03,800
Eastern Sea is under the jurisdiction
of the court, so I took the cauldron

546
00:41:03,800 --> 00:41:04,800
You!

547
00:41:05,200 --> 00:41:09,200
Ma Ruyi stripped in my presence
but I got beaten up

548
00:41:09,200 --> 00:41:11,800
-What crime did I commit?
-Well....

549
00:41:11,800 --> 00:41:15,200
And you! You assaulted the constables

550
00:41:15,200 --> 00:41:16,800
-I...
-What!

551
00:41:17,200 --> 00:41:21,800
I took you as my wife legally

552
00:41:23,400 --> 00:41:27,800
-Your Lordship, I did no wrong
-That was a load of crap

553
00:41:28,000 --> 00:41:29,800
-Who uttered crap?
-You!

554
00:41:30,200 --> 00:41:35,200
You claimed he uttered nonsense.
So what makes me think you're not?

555
00:41:36,200 --> 00:41:38,200
We're the witnesses

556
00:41:38,200 --> 00:41:40,800
How about material evidence?

557
00:41:43,400 --> 00:41:46,200
Even if you had witnesses and
material evidence,

558
00:41:46,200 --> 00:41:49,800
Magistrate Shi is still
a court official

559
00:41:49,800 --> 00:41:53,400
He should be handed over to
the Board of Punishments

560
00:41:53,400 --> 00:41:56,200
What are you people
trying to do here?

561
00:41:56,400 --> 00:41:59,200
Lord Wei, you're the Top Scholar

562
00:41:59,200 --> 00:42:04,800
Who will answer to His Majesty
if he learns about this?

563
00:42:09,000 --> 00:42:11,800
Don't bite more than you can chew

564
00:42:16,200 --> 00:42:18,800
I'll take care of this

565
00:42:19,400 --> 00:42:22,800
You needn't fret over it

566
00:42:23,200 --> 00:42:25,800
Be on your way

567
00:42:26,400 --> 00:42:29,200
-We'll be going
-I'll go keep the laundry

568
00:42:34,200 --> 00:42:36,200
I'll go keep the laundry

569
00:42:36,200 --> 00:42:40,200
Thank you, Your Lordship.
I could have died at their hands

570
00:42:40,200 --> 00:42:44,200
Wei Delu has no regard for the law.
Are we going to indulge him?

571
00:42:44,200 --> 00:42:46,200
We must know when to retreat

572
00:42:46,400 --> 00:42:50,200
Wei Delu is throwing his weight about
as Her Highness is backing him

573
00:42:50,200 --> 00:42:52,400
Why take it up with him?

574
00:42:53,200 --> 00:42:56,800
Just wait and see.
His good days are coming to an end

575
00:42:56,800 --> 00:42:59,800
That is reassuring

576
00:43:02,200 --> 00:43:06,200
Is the pill cauldron really
that amazing?

577
00:43:06,200 --> 00:43:10,800
Yes. Mei Shouquan used it to
make drugs to remove the epidemic

578
00:43:15,200 --> 00:43:20,800
In that case, I wonder if it can be
used to make the elixir of life

579
00:43:21,400 --> 00:43:22,800
Certainly!

580
00:43:23,400 --> 00:43:25,200
In that case...

581
00:43:26,600 --> 00:43:29,800
I know what to do, Your Lordship

582
00:43:29,800 --> 00:43:33,400
I'll arrange for the cauldron to be
sent to Your Lordship's residence

583
00:43:33,400 --> 00:43:38,000
May longevity be Your Lordship's

584
00:43:43,200 --> 00:43:47,200
You're not a stupid man.
I've not used the wrong person

585
00:43:47,400 --> 00:43:49,200
I'll see to it now, Your Lordship

586
00:43:55,200 --> 00:43:57,200
Greetings, Your Lordship

587
00:43:57,200 --> 00:44:01,200
-Have you carried out my instruction?
-Yes. Except Her Highness'...

588
00:44:02,800 --> 00:44:03,800
Yes

589
00:44:05,200 --> 00:44:09,800
Except Her Highness' maid,
the rest of the people work for us

590
00:44:09,800 --> 00:44:11,200
Assign clever men

591
00:44:11,200 --> 00:44:16,400
They just need to report on who
Her Highness meets and what she does

592
00:44:16,400 --> 00:44:18,800
-Don't upset Her Highness
-Yes

593
00:44:19,000 --> 00:44:22,800
Something puzzles me. Why did Your
Lordship bring Her Highness along?

594
00:44:22,800 --> 00:44:24,800
Her presence will only impede us

595
00:44:24,800 --> 00:44:28,400
I had a hard time convincing her
I played no part in the poisoning

596
00:44:28,400 --> 00:44:31,000
I'll be worried if she stays
in the Capital

597
00:44:31,200 --> 00:44:35,200
I don't want any rumours
to affect our wedding plans

598
00:44:35,400 --> 00:44:38,200
Your Lordship doesn't need
Her Highness' assistance

599
00:44:38,200 --> 00:44:42,400
We have ample wealth and
a big army to serve our purpose

600
00:44:42,400 --> 00:44:46,800
We can easily charge up north
and catch them unawares

601
00:44:46,800 --> 00:44:50,800
Your Lordship will then ascend
the throne and rule the land

602
00:44:52,200 --> 00:44:53,200
Subtitled by A Han


